  ('Slip-Fit Steel Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, MOD 0.8, 20T)', '2322-4008-0020', 'This 20 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. Slip-fit components save real estate when a nearby component can provide the axial constraint. That convenient space-saving accumulates all the more when multiple slip-fit components are used in the same assembly, like a gear train! Slip-fit components require axial constraint. This can be provided by nearby components, as well as any surfaces that prevent the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/slip-fit-steel-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-mod-0-8-20t/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2484/images/16571/2322-4008-0020_Scaled_Thumb__31323.1776460041.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Slip-Fit Steel Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, MOD 0.8, 24T)', '2322-4008-0024', 'This 24 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. Slip-fit components save real estate when a nearby component can provide the axial constraint. That convenient space-saving accumulates all the more when multiple slip-fit components are used in the same assembly, like a gear train! Slip-fit components require axial constraint. This can be provided by nearby components, as well as any surfaces that prevent the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/slip-fit-steel-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-mod-0-8-24t/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2485/images/16587/2322-4008-0024_Scaled_Thumb__49002.1776460217.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Slip-Fit Steel Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, MOD 0.8, 30T)', '2322-4008-0030', 'This 30 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. Slip-fit components save real estate when a nearby component can provide the axial constraint. That convenient space-saving accumulates all the more when multiple slip-fit components are used in the same assembly, like a gear train! Slip-fit components require axial constraint. This can be provided by nearby components, as well as any surfaces that prevent the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/slip-fit-steel-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-mod-0-8-30t/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2486/images/16597/2322-4008-0030_Scaled_Thumb__44498.1776460356.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Slip-Fit Steel Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, MOD 0.8, 36T)', '2322-4008-0036', 'This 36 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. Slip-fit components save real estate when a nearby component can provide the axial constraint. That convenient space-saving accumulates all the more when multiple slip-fit components are used in the same assembly, like a gear train! Slip-fit components require axial constraint. This can be provided by nearby components, as well as any surfaces that prevent the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/slip-fit-steel-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-mod-0-8-36t/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2487/images/16615/2322-4008-0036_Scaled_Thumb__50848.1776460516.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Slip-Fit Steel Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, MOD 0.8, 40T)', '2322-4008-0040', 'This 40 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. Slip-fit components save real estate when a nearby component can provide the axial constraint. That convenient space-saving accumulates all the more when multiple slip-fit components are used in the same assembly, like a gear train! Slip-fit components require axial constraint. This can be provided by nearby components, as well as any surfaces that prevent the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/slip-fit-steel-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-mod-0-8-40t/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2488/images/16629/2322-4008-0040_Scaled_Thumb__90344.1776460640.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('48mm Badlands Tank-Track (24mm Pitch, 48mm Width, Rubber Tread) - 6 Pack', '2400-0048-0001', 'Tracks declare their presence with their aggressive poise—as well as the rumbling that says to clear the way, or get run over! While these 48mm width Badlands Tank-Tracks cover less physical ground than their 112mm width siblings, they don''t take any back seat in terms of performance. Their 48mm width provides ample traction with less rotating mass, allowing your motors to focus their torque on tackling the obstacle rather than exerting energy to overcome the heft of your drive system.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/48mm-badlands-tank-track-24mm-pitch-48mm-width-rubber-tread-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2398/images/15000/Ang3__22960__02776.1750790999.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('48mm Grid-Track (24mm Pitch, 48mm Width) - 6 Pack', '2400-0048-0002', 'With their on-pattern thru-holes, rugged Grid-Tracks can combine with goBILDA® components to conquer challenging terrain! Acetal plastic Grid-Tracks traverse grass more gently than rubber tracks. They also turn more efficiently on high-grip surfaces like carpet! And if you''d like to combine different styles of tracks to dial-in exactly the traction you want for a variety of environments, you can mix-and-match 48mm Width Grid-Tracks with 48mm Width Badlands Tank-Tracks —they both share a 24mm…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/48mm-grid-track-24mm-pitch-48mm-width-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2397/images/14982/Ang3__23884__61130.1750790950.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Badlands Tank Track (24mm Pitch, 112mm Width, Rubber Tread) - 6 Pack', '2400-0112-0001', 'These large, heavy-duty tracks will make your day and be the pride of your build! They are easy to integrate into the rest of your goBILDA project and the 24mm pitch makes them play well with channel. The body of each track segment is made of low-friction, high-wear acetal with durable rubber tread bonded to the top. The segments are held together with M4 bolts and locknuts making it extremely easy to add and remove segments to create whatever length of track you need.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/badlands-tank-track-24mm-pitch-112mm-width-rubber-tread-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1623/images/16660/2400-0112-0001_Ang3__03227.1777305658.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Grid-Track (24mm Pitch, 112mm Width) - 6 Pack', '2400-0112-0002', 'Ruggedly robust and on-pattern, Grid-Tracks can combine with goBILDA® components to conquer challenging terrain! Acetal plastic Grid-Tracks traverse grass more gently than tracks with rubber treads. They also turn more efficiently on high-grip surfaces like carpet! And thanks to their 24mm pitch, you can mix-and-match Grid-Tracks with Badlands Tank Tracks to dial-in exactly the traction you want for a variety of environments. Most importantly, Grid-Tracks'' 8mm pattern holes create a huge…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/grid-track-24mm-pitch-112mm-width-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1785/images/16663/2400-0112-0002_Ang1__78879.1777306018.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('2401 Series 24mm Pitch Track Sprocket (12 Tooth) - 2 Pack', '2401-0014-0012', 'This 12 tooth track sprocket is designed for our 2400 Series Tracks. The sprockets mesh with the outsides of the tracks, to drive them and provide excellent support for high-load applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2401-series-24mm-pitch-track-sprocket-12-tooth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1625/images/8527/2401-0014-0012_Ang1__08450__67514.1701993494.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('terraGROUSER (16mm Height) - 6 Pack', '2402-0016-0001', 'terraGROUSERS are 16mm protrusions you can fasten to the top of Grid-Tracks to increase traction on loose terrain. Grousers spaced far apart enable their track to engage with larger rocks and debris, while tighter-spaced grousers provide excellent traction on looser surfaces like snow, sand, and silt. And regardless of configuration, their installation is easy and robust thanks to hex counterbores that hold hex nuts when you''re fastening screws from either top or bottom! This 6-Pack includes 6…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/terragrouser-16mm-height-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1787/images/9508/2402-0016-0001_Ang1__10336__57636.1701993809.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('2405 Series Track Idler Wheel (14mm Bore, 54mm Diameter) - 2 Pack', '2405-0014-0054', 'This Track Idler Wheel is the main component in the 2407-0001-0001 Track Idler Wheel Kit which uses 4mm ID bearings which ride on an M4 screw. Purchasing this wheel by itself allows you to insert different bearings in order to run it on the shaft of your choice.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2405-series-track-idler-wheel-14mm-bore-54mm-diameter-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1672/images/8732/2405-0014-0054_01__21512__69422.1701993563.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Rubber Tread for 3313 Series Grid-Chain (50A Durometer) - 50 Pack', '2408-0001-0001', 'Rubber Treads stretch over goBILDA® Grid-Chain to create high-grip tracks driven by 8mm pitch sprockets. They provide terrific traction in treacherous terrain!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/rubber-tread-for-3313-series-grid-chain-50a-durometer-50-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1816/images/9759/2408-0001-0001__98476__82726.1701993893.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Tumbleweed Tank Track (800mm Length, 50A Durometer Treads)', '2409-0001-0001', 'Tumbleweed Tank Tracks provide great grip even on difficult ground. They''re an excellent solution in projects like small-scale tank builds! Each of the 50 treaded segments of 8mm pitch Tumbleweed Tank Tracks consists of three components: a link of Plastic Chain, a link of Grid-Chain, and a Rubber Tread. This means you can mix and match with additional Plastic Chain and Grid-Chain to your preference!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/tumbleweed-tank-track-800mm-length-50a-durometer-treads/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1820/images/9799/2409-0001-0001__90458__74137.1701993905.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Plastic Track Connecting-Pin (4mm Diameter, 48mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2410-0004-0048', 'The 48mm width variants of the tracks we offer (Badlands Tank-Tracks, and Grid-Tracks) have a nice heft, but sometimes you need to take off the tonnage! These plastic track pins can replace the metal pins included with the tracks to shave off a substantial amount of rotating mass from your chassis. And as they can be easily removed and reinstalled, they make your tracks serviceable without tools. These durable, battle-tested pins offer an awesome 31% of weight savings per segment for 48mm…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/plastic-track-connecting-pin-4mm-diameter-48mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2396/images/14963/ang1__31664__40047.1750782638.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('24mm Pitch, Acetal Track Sprocket (8 Tooth) - 2 Pack', '2411-0014-0008', 'This 8 Tooth variant is the smallest of our 24mm Pitch Acetal Track Sprocket options. Its diameter creates a tight radius that 48mm Width Badlands Tank-Tracks and Grid-Tracks can run on when space is limited. This compactness pairs it well with 1143 Series Mini Low-Side U-Channel (a fantastic skeleton for a smaller-scale chassis) and yields a low overall height of only 80mm when used with 48mm Width Badlands Tank-Tracks. This sprocket interfaces with the track segments to create a positive…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/24mm-pitch-acetal-track-drive-8-tooth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2395/images/14958/Ang1__24177__45709.1750782622.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('24mm Pitch, Acetal Track Sprocket (12 Tooth) - 2 Pack', '2411-0014-0012', 'This 12 Tooth, 24mm Pitch Acetal Track Sprocket can be used with Badlands Tank-Tracks and Grid-Tracks. While each segment of 48mm Width Badlands Tank-Tracks and Grid-Tracks interfaces with a single sprocket via the center of the track, the 112mm width versions of those tracks utilize two sprockets that are placed on the outside edges. This sprocket interfaces with the track segments to create a positive drive while playing double-duty to give the tracks great stability and alignment. Its…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/24mm-pitch-acetal-track-sprocket-12-tooth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2394/images/15003/Ang1__27883.1750879737.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('24mm Pitch, Acetal Track Sprocket (16 Tooth) - 2 Pack', '2411-0014-0016', 'This 16 Tooth, 24mm Pitch Acetal Track Sprocket can be used with Badlands Tank-Tracks and Grid-Tracks. While each segment of 48mm Width Badlands Tank-Tracks and Grid-Tracks interfaces with a single sprocket via the center of the track, the 112mm width versions of those tracks utilize two sprockets that are placed on the outside edges. This sprocket interfaces with the track segments to create a positive drive while playing double-duty to give the tracks great stability and alignment. Its…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/24mm-pitch-acetal-track-sprocket-16-tooth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2393/images/15469/Ang1_4__79036.1762882473.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Tracks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Viper-Slide (10-Ball Carriage, 240mm Length, 174mm Travel)', '2500-0010-0240', 'These 240mm Length goBILDA® Viper-Slides are smooth and strong solutions for your linear motion needs. They offer 174mm of travel— which can be in either direction! Viper-Slides excel in lifting and reaching mechanisms. Their steel construction allows one(1) slide to bear a load that would typically call for two aluminum slides. Steel slides also don''t wear over time the way aluminum slides do. The 4mm thru holes, 4mm slots, and clearance holes make it extremely easy to fasten these slides to one(2)…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-viper-slide-10-ball-carriage-240mm-length-174mm-travel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2010/images/11024/2500-0010-0240_Ang2__31498__31260.1701994288.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Slides', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Viper-Slide (14-Ball Carriage, 336mm Length, 244mm Travel)', '2500-0014-0336', 'These 336mm Length goBILDA® Viper-Slides are smooth and strong solutions for your linear motion needs. These slides offer 244mm of travel— which can be in either direction ! Viper-Slides excel in lifting and reaching mechanisms. Their steel construction allows one(3) slide to bear a load that would typically call for two aluminum slides. Steel slides also don''t wear over time the way aluminum slides do. The 4mm thru holes, 4mm slots, and clearance holes make it extremely easy to fasten these…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-viper-slide-14-ball-carriage-336mm-length-244mm-travel/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1622/images/13611/Ang1__06086.1729286440.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Slides', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel End-Stop for Viper-Slide (1-1) - 6 Pack', '2501-0001-0001', 'The 2501-0001-0001 acts as both an End-Stop and as a threaded spacer and is designed for use with the 2500-0014-0336 Viper Slide. This pack includes six End-Stops and twenty 5mm length M4 button head screws (2802-0004-0005).', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-end-stop-for-viper-slide-1-1-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1624/images/8508/2501-0001-0001-Ang1__42257__76639.1701993489.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Slides', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Pulley Bracket for Viper-Slide (1-2) - 4 Pack', '2501-0001-0002', 'This 2501-0001-0002 Pulley Bracket is designed for use with the 2500-0014-0336 Viper Slide. This pack includes four pulley brackets and twelve 5mm length M4 button head screws (2802-0004-0005).', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-pulley-bracket-for-viper-slide-1-2-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1626/images/8534/2501-0001-0002-Rev1-Ang1__25783__26380.1701993497.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Slides', 'gobilda'),
  ('goBILDA Sticker Sheet', '2600-0001-0002', 'Show your goBILDA pride! This sticker sheet gives you a half dozen chances to throw our brand on your robot, toolbox, car or wherever you choose to put them! These high-quality stickers are weather resistant and uv-coated to prevent fading.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-sticker-sheet/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1417/images/7034/2600-0001-0002-REV1__62618__91098.1701993042.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MERCH', 'gobilda'),
  ('goBILDA® Lanyard', '2600-0003-0001', 'The goBILDA® build system allows for extraordinary attachment possibilities—including the emotional attachment of its fans! If you''re so attached that you want to show off your fandom to the world, you''ll love the ability to keep your personal belongings attached to yourself with this goBILDA® Lanyard! This nifty loop of fashionability and utility features a split key ring for holding things like nametags, keychains, or even your favorite goBILDA® component. A safety release connection helps…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-lanyard/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2341/images/14314/2600-0003-0001-goBILDA-Lanyard-Landscape__32927__44925.1736522128.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MERCH', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Socket Head Screw (M3 x 0.5mm, 6mm Length) - 6 Pack', '2800-0003-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-socket-head-screw-m3-x-0-5mm-6mm-length-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1878/images/10091/2800-0003-0006__86888__86856.1701993994.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M3 Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Socket Head Screw (M3 x 0.5mm, 8mm Length) - 6 Pack', '2800-0003-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-socket-head-screw-m3-x-0-5mm-8mm-length-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1877/images/10089/2800-0003-0008__66326__94365.1701993993.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M3 Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Socket Head Screw (M3 x 0.5mm, 10mm Length) - 6 Pack', '2800-0003-0010', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-socket-head-screw-m3-x-0-5mm-10mm-length-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1879/images/10093/2800-0003-0010__22006__87813.1701993994.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M3 Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
