  ('2802 Series Zinc-Plated Steel Button Head Screw (M4 x 0.7mm, 50mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2802-0004-0050', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2802-series-zinc-plated-steel-button-head-screw-m4-x-0-7mm-50mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/499/images/3297/2802-0004-0050__55461__94879.1701991852.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Button Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('2802 Series Zinc-Plated Steel Button Head Screw (M4 x 0.7mm, 55mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2802-0004-0055', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2802-series-zinc-plated-steel-button-head-screw-m4-x-0-7mm-55mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/501/images/3301/2802-0004-0055__96426__70331.1701991854.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Button Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('2802 Series Zinc-Plated Steel Button Head Screw (M4 x 0.7mm, 60mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2802-0004-0060', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2802-series-zinc-plated-steel-button-head-screw-m4-x-0-7mm-60mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/502/images/3304/2802-0004-0060__40679__12871.1701991856.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Button Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('M4 x 0.7mm Square Nut - 25 Pack', '2803-0007-0007', 'The smallest of the stainless steel threaded plates; the M4 square nut has large flat sides making it easy to grip them with a wrench or pair of pliers. In certain applications the larger clearance diameter will cause these nuts to contact an adjacent wall so that no tool is needed to hold it in place while tightening and loosening.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/m4-x-0-7mm-square-nut-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/504/images/3309/2803-0007-0007__41572__22041.1726160332.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('2 x 3 Hole Steel Threaded Plate (16mm x 24mm) - 2 Pack', '2803-0016-0024', 'These steel screw plates are excellent general-purpose screw plates to have on-hand when building. Each plate''s three on-pattern threaded holes give you multiple fastening options while dispersing the loads exerted on the structure they are holding together. These plates are especially helpful as fastening solutions in low-clearance applications where conventional tools and hardware (like hex nuts, and the tools that hold them) do not fit.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2-x-3-hole-steel-threaded-plate-16mm-x-24mm-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2270/images/13432/2803-0016-0024__06764__45912.1727900595.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1 x 3 Hole Steel Threaded Plate (7mm x 23mm) - 4 Pack', '2803-0023-0007', 'These steel screw plates are excellent general-purpose screw plates to have on-hand when building. Each plate''s three on-pattern threaded holes give you multiple fastening options while dispersing the loads exerted on the structure they are holding together. These plates are especially helpful as fastening solutions in low-clearance applications where conventional tools and hardware (like hex nuts, and the tools that hold them) do not fit.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1-x-3-hole-steel-threaded-plate-7mm-x-23mm-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2271/images/13438/2803-0023-0007__25462__94773.1727900641.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('16mm Square Pattern Steel Threaded Plate - 2 Pack', '2803-0023-0023', 'This screw plate aligns with the 16mm pattern. The four threaded holes allow you to tighten screws down without having to hold nuts from turning during assembly. The surface area disperses potential forces on the structure the plate is used on, therefore increasing the strength.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/16mm-square-pattern-steel-threaded-plate-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/506/images/3316/2803-0023-0023__30411__26022.1701991859.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1 x 5 Hole Steel Threaded Plate (7mm x 39mm) - 2 Pack', '2803-0039-0007', 'These screw plates are an excellent general purpose screw plate to have on-hand when building. The five holes all on grid give you multiple fastening options, while dispersing the loads exerted on the structure they are holding together.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1-x-5-hole-steel-threaded-plate-7mm-x-39mm-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/508/images/3322/2803-0039-0007__03095__02213.1701991861.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Steel Channel-Connector Plate - 2 Pack', '2803-0039-0022', 'While it may be as universal as the other screw plates, the design allows you to fasten pattern-based structure (channel, low channel, pattern brackets) end-to-end.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/steel-channel-connector-plate-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/510/images/3329/2803-0039-0022__29294__32490.1701991863.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('32mm Square Pattern Steel Threaded Plate - 2 Pack', '2803-0039-0039', 'The large square shape of this screw plate stretches out to the 32mm pattern maximizing the amount of area between attachment points.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/32mm-square-pattern-steel-threaded-plate-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/503/images/11313/2803-0039-0039_V2__22415.1708977664.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
