  ('M8 x 1.25mm to goBILDA Pattern Mount', '2814-0016-0008', 'This Stainless Steel Pattern Plate has the goBILDA 16mm square pattern and 24mm diagonal pattern with an M8 x 1.25mm threaded center. It makes it easy to added M8 x 1.25mm screws and items with M8 x 1.25mm studs to your goBILDA project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/m8-x-1-25mm-to-gobilda-pattern-mount/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1638/images/8592/2814-0016-0008__35227__21572.1701993517.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('1/4"-20 to goBILDA Pattern Mount', '2814-0016-0250', 'This Stainless Steel Pattern Plate has the goBILDA 16mm square pattern and 24mm diagonal pattern with a 1/4"-20 threaded center. It makes it easy to add a 1/4"-20 screw or a threaded rod to your goBILDA project.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1-4-20-to-gobilda-pattern-mount/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1640/images/8599/2814-0016-0250__06072__44920.1701993519.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Threaded Plates', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Thread-Forming Socket Head Screw (M4 x 6mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2815-0004-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-thread-forming-socket-head-screw-m4-x-6mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1662/images/8690/2815-0004-0006__76624__25108.1701993548.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Thread-Forming Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Thread-Forming Socket Head Screw (M4 x 8mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2815-0004-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-thread-forming-socket-head-screw-m4-x-8mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1665/images/8697/2815-0004-0008__02816__13576.1701993551.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Thread-Forming Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Thread-Forming Socket Head Screw (M4 x 10mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2815-0004-0010', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-thread-forming-socket-head-screw-m4-x-10mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1667/images/8704/2815-0004-0010__45085__44978.1701993553.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Thread-Forming Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Thread-Forming Socket Head Screw (M4 x 12mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2815-0004-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-thread-forming-socket-head-screw-m4-x-12mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1669/images/8722/2815-0004-0012__64239__11339.1701993559.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Thread-Forming Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zinc-Plated Steel Thread-Forming Socket Head Screw (M4 x 16mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2815-0004-0016', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zinc-plated-steel-thread-forming-socket-head-screw-m4-x-16mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1671/images/8726/2815-0004-0016__86014__24353.1701993560.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / M4 Thread-Forming Socket Head Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Hook-Nut (M4 x 0.7mm Thread) - 25 Pack', '2816-0004-0001', 'When used on goBILDA components, this nut conveniently hooks into a nearby 4mm hole to keep the nut from rotating while you tighten the screw.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/hook-nut-m4-x-0-7mm-thread-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1664/images/8696/2816-0004-0001__75053__85447.1701993550.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Nuts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (6mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0006', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-6mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2382/images/14697/2822-0004-0006__60658__53750.1744657189.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (8mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0008', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-8mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2239/images/13333/2822-0004-0008__05462__67224.1726003838.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (10mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0010', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-10mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2240/images/13335/2822-0004-0010__28157__29464.1726003859.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (12mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0012', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-12mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2241/images/13337/2822-0004-0012__12567__70119.1726003887.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (14mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0014', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-14mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2242/images/13339/2822-0004-0014__29381__04915.1726003901.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screw (16mm Length) - 25 Pack', '2822-0004-0016', 'This Premium Thread-Locking M4 Socket Head Screw has a super-resilient grade 12.9 material and a blue nylon patch that provides for incredible resistance to loosening from vibration.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/premium-m4-socket-head-thread-locking-screw-16mm-length-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2501/images/16430/2822-0004-0016__38725.1773930683.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Screws / Premium M4 Socket Head Thread-Locking Screws', 'gobilda'),
  ('2900 Series Shock (120-1) - 2 Pack', '2900-0120-0001', 'The threaded aluminum body of this oil-filled shock provides quick and easy adjustment of the preload. Loosen the spring up to ride low in the stroke of the shock and allow for a large amount of droop, or tighten it up to create a stiffer chassis that rides higher in the stroke.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2900-series-shock-120-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/523/images/3358/2900-0120-0001__34336__79440.1701991873.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Big Bore Shock (190mm Length, Black) - 2 Pack', '2900-0190-0001', 'These massive oil-filled shock absorbers are ready to soak up the terrain! Between the aluminum body, the 6mm shock-shaft and heavy spring rate, they''re excellent for larger custom builds and 1/5 scale R/C projects. The shocks contain eyelets that are able to accept M4 or 8-32 UNC hardware for a solid mounting solution. The aluminum main-body is threaded so that you can adjust your oil level or swap it for a different weight. The threads are also used for the preload adjustment nut - the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/big-bore-shock-190mm-length-black-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1614/images/8448/2900-0190-0001__87090__07021.1701993469.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('2901 Series Shock Mount (1-1) - 2 Pack', '2901-0001-0001', 'These aluminum shock mounts are directly compatible with the 2900-0120-0001. The single mounting point allows for ease of mounting with M4 hardware.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2901-series-shock-mount-1-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/524/images/3365/2901-0001-0001__96474__21100.1701991875.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shocks', 'gobilda'),
  ('Plastic Hinge - 2 Pack', '2902-0003-0001', 'This Plastic Hinge brings swivel functionality to your build and is built on the revolutionary versatility of Plastic Hinge Blocks. Use it as a standard hinge, or swing into non-hinge applications by tightening a bolt to secure the blocks at a specific angle–easily measured thanks to grooves at 45° on each block!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/plastic-hinge-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1726/images/9049/2902-0003-0001_Ang10__97901__77073.1701993663.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hinges', 'gobilda'),
  ('2902 Series Hinge (5 Hole, 38mm Length)', '2902-0005-0038', 'This hinge is capable of 278 degrees of rotation and has threaded holes spaced 8mm apart. It''s constructed of aluminum with a stainless steel pin that''s been pressed in.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2902-series-hinge-5-hole-38mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/526/images/3377/2902-0005-0038__32831__93542.1701991878.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hinges', 'gobilda'),
  ('Plastic Hinge Block - 25 Pack', '2902-0025-0001', 'Plastic Hinge Blocks open the door to swivel functionality across a variety of installations. Their on-pattern design allows for a myriad of creative combinations. Fasten multiple blocks together with an M4 screw and a locknut to create the perfect hinge for your project, or explore non-hinge applications by tightening a bolt to secure the blocks at a specific angle–easily measured thanks to grooves at 45° on each block!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/plastic-hinge-block-25-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1728/images/9073/2902-0025-0001__15221__51333.1701993670.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hinges', 'gobilda'),
  ('2903 Series Nylon Ball Linkage (M4, 24.5mm Length) - 4 Pack', '2903-0004-0245', 'This nylon ball linkage has a female shank which allows an M4 fastener or threaded rod to form threads as it''s inserted. The steel ball end is able to swivel freely inside the nylon body so that your linkage assembly transfers the force acting on it without robbing unnecessary power. The included cupped washer can be used in order to increase the range of motion by adding clearance between the body and the fastener that is used to attach the ball to your control surface.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2903-series-nylon-ball-linkage-m4-24-5mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/528/images/3387/2903-0004-0245__83425__48421.1701991881.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linkages & Threaded Rods / M4 Ball Linkages', 'gobilda'),
  ('2904 Series Hole Reducer (4mm ID x 14mm OD) - 4 Pack', '2904-0004-0014', 'This hole reducer fits in a 14mm hole and reduces the bore to 4mm. The reducer protrudes 1mm into the 14mm hole so that a pair of them can clad a part with 2.5mm thickness, such as U-Channel or Low-Side U-Channel, and tightly squeeze down on the channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2904-series-hole-reducer-4mm-id-x-14mm-od-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/530/images/11314/2904-0004-0014__25737.1709221189.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hole Reducers', 'gobilda'),
  ('14mm to 8mm Hole Reducer - 4 Pack', '2904-0008-0014', 'This hole reducer fits over an 8mm OD (or 8mm REX™) shaft and indexes into a 14mm hole. In some assemblies, 14mm bore hub-mount components can get farther away from the hub than is ideal. This hole reducer offers a means to remove the cantilever from your assembly by transferring the force from the 14mm bore down to the shaft. Another use-case for this hole reducer is to allow you to use M8 hardware in a 14mm hole.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/14mm-to-8mm-hole-reducer-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1882/images/10104/2904-0008-0014__48790__15414.1701993998.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hole Reducers', 'gobilda'),
  ('14mm to 1/4" Hole Reducer (1mm Insertion-Depth) - 2 Pack', '2904-1025-0014', 'This 14mm to ¼" hole reducer allows you to integrate components that use imperial hardware with goBILDA. For example, much of the camera market is based around ¼-20 hardware, from tripods to suction cups to camera mounts and plates. These reducers can be used individually on the reverse side of the item that you''re attaching so that, when the ¼-20 bolt that passes through is tightened down, it sandwiches the channel or component that it is resting within. Alternatively,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/14mm-to-1-4-hole-reducer-1mm-insertion-depth-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1428/images/7067/2904-1025-0014__95951__19539.1701993053.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Hole Reducers', 'gobilda'),
  ('2905 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (6mm Bore, 8mm Length)', '2905-0006-0008', 'This clamping collar fastens securely to a 6mm round or 6mm D-shaft to restrict axial movement of the shaft and adjacent parts. The profile allows us to integrate a M4 pinch bolt so you can tighten it down with a 3mm hex key.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2905-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-6mm-bore-8mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/532/images/3397/2905-0006-0008__68676__74894.1701991884.386.513.png?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2906 Series Aluminum Set Screw Collar (6mm Bore, 8mm Length) - 2 Pack', '2906-0006-0008', 'Set screw collars are the smallest of all the collars. They create less rotating mass and are well balanced so they don''t create vibration in high-speed applications. Set screw collars are best used with D-shaft so the set screw doesn''t marr an edge that might come in contact with a bearing.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2906-series-aluminum-set-screw-collar-6mm-bore-8mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/534/images/3401/2906-0006-0008__88839__51362.1701991886.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Latex Surgical Tubing (3mm ID x 5mm OD, 2M Length)', '2907-0305-0002', 'This latex tubing, commonly referred to as surgical tubing has excellent elasticity and strength. It can be used as webbing between structures, tread on a wheel for added traction,a retract mechanism on a linear slide, or as a collection mechanism on a spinning device to name a few.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/latex-surgical-tubing-3mm-id-x-5mm-od-2m-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/536/images/3403/2907-0305-0002__23225__06182.1701991887.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / Intake Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('Synthetic Cable (0.75mm Diameter, 5 meter Length)', '2908-0075-0005', 'Our synthetic cable measures only 0.75mm in diameter but is capable of holding up to 45kg! Wind it around a spool to create a winch, connect it to a flap on your r/c airplane, attach it to your animatronic skeleton phalanges or tie to your robot''s grappling hook. The cable has very little memory; meaning you can wind it tight, kink it or run it around a corner without worrying about it holding that shape in the future.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/synthetic-cable-0-75mm-diameter-5-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/538/images/3405/2908-0075-0005__36049__06275.1701991889.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Synthetic Cable (1mm Diameter, 5 meter Length)', '2908-0100-0005', 'This synthetic cable only measures 1mm in diameter, but it''s capable of holding up to 45kg! Wind it around a spool to create a winch, connect it to a flap on an r/c airplane, attach it to an animatronic skeleton''s phalanges, or tie to a robot''s grappling hook—just to name a few use-cases. The cable has very little memory, which means you can wind it tight, kink it, or run it around a corner without worrying about it holding that shape in the future. Tech Tips Tying a knot can reduce a line''s…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/synthetic-cable-1mm-diameter-5-meter-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2014/images/11038/2908-0100-0005__76483__84444.1701994299.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Cable', 'gobilda'),
  ('Zip Tie (100mm Length, Black) - 100 Pack', '2909-0101-0100', 'No introduction is needed here. These zip ties are 100mm (4") long and come in packs of 100. Use them to maintain a clean and professional looking build or keep spares in your toolbox as a last resort patch job in the heat of competition.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/zip-tie-100mm-length-black-100-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/540/images/3410/2909-0101-0100__46994__74600.1701991889.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('goBILDA® Hook & Loop Cinch-Strap (20mm Width x 250mm Length) - 4 Pack', '2909-0102-0250', 'Hook yourself a metaphorical big fish of versatile attachment options with our Hook and Loop Cinch-Strap! It''s a cincher for organizing wire or strapping components to one(7) another on-the-fly. The hook-and-loop strap has two parts: the hook, and the loop. Together, they create a super-adjustable binding mechanism that secures itself in such a way as to raise a flag for order against the universal force of entropy, allowing you to create heightened organization for your build or ''bot in which…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-hook-loop-cinch-strap-20mm-width-x-250mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2418/images/15202/Ang2__34828__21279.1758298529.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Cinch-Straps', 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (6mm ID x 16mm OD, 8mm Length)', '2910-0816-0006', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by 2910-0919-0006. The 2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collars provide a non-marring fastening mechanism that creates a super-tight hold on round or d-profile shafting. The compact outer profile minimizes the clearance diameter so other parts can be fastened in close proximity within your chassis.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-6mm-id-x-16mm-od-8mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/954/images/4863/2910-0816-0006__23429__22934.1701992337.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (8mm ID x 18mm OD, 8mm Length)', '2910-0818-0008', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by 2910-0921-0008. The 2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collars provide a non-marring fastening mechanism that creates a super-tight hold on a shaft. The compact outer profile minimizes the clearance diameter so other parts can be fastened in close proximity without coming in contact.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-8mm-id-x-18mm-od-8mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/858/images/4689/2910-0818-0008__13009__28051.1701992270.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (6mm ID x 19mm OD, 9mm Length)', '2910-0919-0006', 'This 6mm Bore Aluminum Clamping Collar has an M4 socket head pinch bolt to provide excellent clamping force on a 6mm round or 6mm D profile shaft. The 0.5mm protrusion on one(8) side allows this collar to run up next to a bearing without the need for a shim. The outer diameter has been minimized in order to provide clearance for other parts in close proximity.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-6mm-id-x-19mm-od-9mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1380/images/6763/2910-0919-0006-Rev1__70928__50081.1701992955.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (8mm REX® ID x 20mm OD, 9mm Length)', '2910-0920-4008', 'This 8mm REX® Bore Clamping Collar has a profile-matched bore in order to maximize holding force on the 8mm REX® Shaft. The 11mm diameter, 0.5mm protrusion on one(9) side of the collar negates the need for a shim or shaft spacer between the collar and a bearing. The protrusion will rest against the inner-race of the bearing, creating a little necessary space between the collar and the outer-race. The M4 pinch bolt uses the same tool as you''ll use with 2800 Series Socket Head Screws that we use…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-8mm-rex-id-x-20mm-od-9mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1431/images/7090/2910-0920-4008__76763__79847.1701993059.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (8mm ID x 21mm OD, 9mm Length)', '2910-0921-0008', 'This 8mm bore aluminum clamping collar provides a non-marring fastening mechanism that creates a super-tight hold on a shaft. The compact outer profile minimizes the clearance diameter so other parts can be fastened in close proximity without coming in contact.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-8mm-id-x-21mm-od-9mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1507/images/7702/2910-0921-0008__57935__20444.1701993241.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (12mm ID x 26mm OD, 9mm Length)', '2910-0926-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-12mm-id-x-26mm-od-9mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1670/images/8724/2910-0926-0012-v3__05096__43913.1701993560.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (8mm REX® ID x 20mm OD, 10mm Length)', '2910-1020-4008', 'This product has been discontinued. It has been replaced by the 2910-0920-4008. This 8mm REX® Bore Clamping Collar has a profile-matched bore in order to maximize holding force on the 8mm REX® Shaft. The 11mm diameter, 0.25mm protrusion on one(10) side of the collar negates the need for a shim or shaft spacer between the collar and a bearing. The protrusion will rest against the inner-race of the bearing, creating a little necessary space between the collar and the outer-race. The M4 pinch bolt…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-8mm-rex-id-x-20mm-od-10mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1267/images/6280/2910-1020-4008__50072__89139.1701992805.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2910 Series Aluminum Clamping Collar (12mm REX® ID x 26mm OD, 10mm Length)', '2910-1026-4012', 'This Aluminum Clamping Collar has a REX® bore to be compatible with our 2102 Series and 2104 Series REX® shafting. The bore perfectly matches the shaft profile in order to provide the most surface area and best hold.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2910-series-aluminum-clamping-collar-12mm-rex-id-x-26mm-od-10mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1083/images/5326/2910-1026-4012__09821__42855.1701992499.386.513.png?c=1', 'MOTION / Collars', 'gobilda'),
  ('Plastic Grommet (14-1) - 12 Pack', '2911-0014-0001', 'This plastic locking grommet is made specifically for a 14mm hole in a 2.5mm thick part. The grommets snap in place with the wings which expand after passing through the 14mm hole.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/plastic-grommet-14-1-12-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/860/images/4696/2911-0014-0001__92419__39397.1701992272.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('Rubber Grommet (14-2) - 4 Pack', '2911-0014-0002', 'Rubber grommets insulate otherwise sharp edges to protect wires and cables from chafing. These grommets can double as a vibration damping foot or mount.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/rubber-grommet-14-2-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/853/images/4673/2911-0014-0002__98700__11867.1701992266.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Rubber Grommet (14-3) - 4 Pack', '2911-0014-0003', 'Rubber grommets insulate otherwise sharp edges to protect wires and cables from chafing. This grommet can double as a vibration-damping foot or mount.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/rubber-grommet-14-3-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2360/images/14380/2911-0014-0003__72784__22483.1738186033.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('2912 Series Neodymium Magnet (5mm Diameter, 1.5mm Thickness) - 2 Pack', '2912-0005-0001', 'This 5mm diameter magnet is made to fit in the recesses found on the Open goRAIL Nut or the Lead Screw Square Nut. By installing a magnet you can create a non-contact limit switch in a linear motion assembly.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2912-series-neodymium-magnet-5mm-diameter-1-5mm-thickness-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1007/images/4976/2912-0005-0001__92708__37279.1701992382.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Magnets', 'gobilda'),
  ('2913 Series Steel Ball Linkage (Female M4 x 0.7mm, 24.1mm Length) - 2 Pack', '2913-0004-0241', 'This steel ball linkage has an M4 threaded female shank so that you can attach it to an M4 screw, threaded rod or ball linkage which has a male shank. The all steel construction makes this ball linkage great for high-demand applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2913-series-steel-ball-linkage-female-m4-x-0-7mm-24-1mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1149/images/5756/2913-0004-0241__75382__24702.1701992635.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linkages & Threaded Rods / M4 Ball Linkages', 'gobilda'),
  ('2913 Series Steel Ball Linkage (Male M4 x 0.7mm, 29.4mm Length) - 2 Pack', '2913-0104-0294', 'This steel ball linkage has an M4 threaded male shank so that you can thread it into a female shank ball linkage, fasten it to a surface using M4 hardware or thread it into an M4 hole. The all steel construction makes this ball linkage great for high-demand applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2913-series-steel-ball-linkage-male-m4-x-0-7mm-29-4mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1143/images/5737/2913-0104-0294__55101__42455.1701992628.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linkages & Threaded Rods / M4 Ball Linkages', 'gobilda'),
  ('V-Groove Bearing Shield (2-1) - 2 Pack', '2914-0002-0001', 'These steel shields were designed specifically for use with 1609 Series V-Groove Bearings. They will help keep your synthetic cable in the correct location when using the bearings as pulleys. Each shield comes with two shims that will slide between the bearing and the inner wall of the shield, allowing the bearing to rotate without contacting the inner wall of the shield.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/v-groove-bearing-shield-2-1-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1127/images/5640/2914-0002-0001-Main__45023__22979.1701992597.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Extension Spring (8mm OD, 6.8kg Max Load, 80-120mm Length)', '2915-0001-0001', 'This extension spring is commonly used with synthetic cable in order to retain tension where the cable path causes slight variances in the amount of slack in the line. The spring has an overall length of 80mm at rest, but can be stretched 40mm for an overall length of 120mm. The loop ends are just shy of 6mm so they can be snugly pressed over a 6mm diameter shaft or tube but they can also be slipped over a smaller diameter post such as an M4 screw. The spring is made from spring-tempered steel…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/extension-spring-8mm-od-6-8kg-max-load-80-120mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1106/images/5501/2915-0001-0001__34008__78671.1701992553.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Extension Spring (8mm OD, 8kg Max Load, 48-80mm Length)', '2915-0001-0002', 'This extension spring is commonly used with synthetic cable in order to retain tension where the cable path causes slight variances in the amount of slack in the line. The spring has an overall center-to-center distance of 48mm at rest, but can be stretched 32mm for an overall length of 80mm. Each loop end has an inner diameter of just over 4mm so it can easily fit onto an M4 screw. The spring is made from spring-tempered steel to retain its rate and shape over thousands of cycles.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/extension-spring-8mm-od-8kg-max-load-48-80mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1680/images/8770/2915-0001-0002__27363__83294.1701993573.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Springs', 'gobilda'),
  ('Extension Spring (6.5mm OD, 1.5kg Max Load, 39-72mm Length)', '2915-0001-0003', 'This steel extension spring—as utilized in our Odometry Pod —provides the crucial downforce that allows the omni wheel to make consistent contact with the soft tile surface used in the First Tech Challenge (FTC). The spring''s 33mm of usable travel yields excellent overall travel for the pod; even when your robot experiences an obstacle, the wheel remains grounded. This spring also has many uses outside odometry. While similar in shape and size, this spring has a lighter pull than the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/extension-spring-6-5mm-od-1-5kg-max-load-39-72mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2013/images/11036/Ang1__26701__93585.1701994293.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Springs', 'gobilda'),
  ('Compression Spring (6mm ID x 8mm OD, 1.1kg Max Load, 4-25mm Length) - 2 Pack', '2916-0001-0001', 'This compression spring is able to slip over a 6mm shaft in order to apply tension between two parts riding on the same shaft. Alternatively, it can be inserted into an 8mm hole to apply a force to a shaft, rod, tube or dowel directly above it. Compression springs can be used to suppress abrupt forces, apply forces in the opposite direction or store energy such as in a trigger or latch assembly. Notice that the spring has a resting length, length at rated load and a length at full compression.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/compression-spring-6mm-id-x-8mm-od-1-1kg-max-load-4-25mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1221/images/6074/2916-0001-0001-Ang2__11301__54454.1701992740.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Springs', 'gobilda'),
  ('Compression Spring (6mm ID x 8mm OD, 2.3kg Max Load, 16-25mm Length) - 2 Pack', '2916-0001-0002', 'This compression spring is able to slip over a 6mm shaft in order to apply tension between two parts riding on the same shaft. Alternatively, it can be inserted into an 8mm hole to apply a force to a shaft, rod, tube or dowel directly above it. Compression springs can be used to suppress abrupt forces, apply forces in the opposite direction or store energy such as in a trigger or latch assembly. Notice that the spring has a resting length, length at rated load and a length at full compression.…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/compression-spring-6mm-id-x-8mm-od-2-3kg-max-load-16-25mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1212/images/6057/2916-0001-0002-Ang2__80551__69866.1701992734.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Springs', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Connector Clip (Yellow) - 6 Pack', '2917-0001-0001', 'These servo connector (aka TJC8) clips help keep servo connections together and aid in tidying up wires for a clean and professional result.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-connector-clip-yellow-6-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1269/images/6290/2917-0001-0001__79098__80279.1701992807.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'ELECTRONICS / Wiring', 'gobilda'),
  ('Replacement Servo Case for 2000 Series Dual Mode Servo (V2.0)', '2918-2000-0001', 'Servos aren''t invincible! A replacement case can provide a face-lift and restore your servo''s shape for proper fitment. It''s a great backup part to have in your toolbox for when your servos return from the ring with a missing mounting ear. This Replacement Case is specific to 2000 Series goBILDA® Servos. Before purchasing this Servo Gear Set, check the top of the case of the servo you''re repairing. If your servo has "BKJ" molded into the top, you''ve come to the right place! If your servo has…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-servo-case-for-2000-series-dual-mode-servo-v2-0/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1366/images/6704/2918-2000-0001__46267__66320.1701992938.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda')
on conflict (btrim(manufacturer), btrim(sku))
